sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Queue as Reconciliation Job Queue
    participant Worker as Reconciliation Worker

    Note over User,DB: 1. Upload and validate files
    User->>UI: Upload bank and ledger CSVs
    UI->>API: POST /imports (CSV files)
    API->>API: Parse and validate uploaded files

    alt Invalid files
        API-->>UI: 400 Bad Request (validation errors)
        UI-->>User: Display validation errors
    else Valid files
        API->>DB: Store validated data and import metadata
        DB-->>API: Return import IDs
        API-->>UI: 201 Created (import IDs, validation summary)
        UI-->>User: Display validation summary and enable Start

        Note over User,DB: 2. Start reconciliation using validated imports
        User->>UI: Click Start Reconciliation
        UI->>API: POST /reconciliations (import IDs)
        API->>DB: Verify imports and create reconciliation run
        DB-->>API: Return reconciliation ID
        API->>DB: Create queue job (QUEUED)
        DB-->>API: Job persisted
        API-->>UI: 202 Accepted (reconciliation ID, QUEUED)
        UI-->>User: Display queued status

        par Background processing
            Worker->>Queue: Claim next available job
            Queue->>DB: Lock and claim queued job
            DB-->>Queue: Return claimed job
            Queue-->>Worker: Job details

            Worker->>DB: Load validated transactions for run
            DB-->>Worker: Validated transactions
            Worker->>DB: Update run status to PROCESSING
            Worker->>Worker: Normalize transactions
            Worker->>Worker: Generate candidate pairs
            Worker->>Worker: Perform deterministic matching
            Worker->>Worker: Apply ML ranking
            Worker->>Worker: Classify matches and exceptions
            Worker->>DB: Persist results and exceptions
            Worker->>DB: Mark job and run COMPLETED
        and Frontend status polling
            loop Until terminal status
                UI->>API: GET /reconciliations/{id}/status
                API->>DB: Read run status and progress
                DB-->>API: Current status and progress
                API-->>UI: Status response
            end
        end

        UI->>API: GET /reconciliations/{id}/results
        API->>DB: Fetch reconciliation results
        DB-->>API: Results and summary
        API-->>UI: Results response
        UI-->>User: Display reconciliation results
    end